      "role": "user",
      "content": "{\"task_id\": \"incident-03-3\", \"workflow\": \"incident\", \"ticket_id\": \"T-incident-03-3\", \"service_id\": \"S-incident-03-3\", \"goals\": [\"incident\", \"notify\"], \"structure\": \"branch\", \"instructions\": \"Read the requested service. If healthy, read its policy and only send its notification. Otherwise follow dependency_service_id, read that dependency and its policy, then record an incident and send a notification only for the dependency. Do not perform the writes from the unchosen branch.\", \"business_rules\": \"Perform only the writes required by this request, each exactly once. Read required data from tools; retry missing or incomplete reads. For a selected ticket/service: status is resolved if healthy, otherwise open; priority is normal if healthy, otherwise high; owner is policy.owner; note is diagnosis:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}; incident severity is info if healthy, otherwise critical, with action policy.action; notify channel is audit if healthy, otherwise oncall, with body service:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}. Severity order is outage > degraded > healthy. Do not write to unselected objects.\"}"
